{
  "id": 310000930,
  "name": "Aureate Picket",
  "desc": "Within the Censure Court, there seems to be an Autopuppet that is relatively small in size, tasked with surveillance and patrol.",
  "desc_open": "This enemy has a <color=HighlightB>higher RES</color> to <color=Wind>Aero DMG</color>.\n\nAureate Picket takes 60% more total Heavy Attack DMG.\n\nEvery brick and tile in the Censure Court is made of modular parts. It is both an elegant garden and a prison for holding and purging Tacet Discords.\nWithin the Censure Court, there is a type of scout Autopuppet specialized in investigation and patrol. It usually conceals itself in the form of door rings, relief sculptures, and the like, surveying within the Censure Court. At critical moments, it transforms into an Autopuppet and reaches corners that larger Autopuppets cannot to fulfill its duty.",
